# Redirect all non-canonical variants to the single HTTPS non-www origin
# Each rule is a direct single 301 — no chaining, no loops

# HTTP non-www → HTTPS non-www
http://aikonx.com.au/*        https://aikonx.com.au/:splat  301!

# HTTP www → HTTPS non-www
http://www.aikonx.com.au/*    https://aikonx.com.au/:splat  301!

# HTTPS www → HTTPS non-www
https://www.aikonx.com.au/*   https://aikonx.com.au/:splat  301!
